{"title":"03-r17-display-and-scope.md","text":"# Harbor R-17 display precision and measurement scope\nDocument status: final companion note for Night Restore R-17.\nSynthetic local evidence only.\nThe dashboard prints whole-number success percentages. Its displayed success percentages for both Quill and Sable are 99 percent. The signed counts, not these rounded dashboard percentages, control the acceptance calculation.\nThe R-17 evidence package provides no maximum recovery time after a power failure for either candidate. Such a value cannot be inferred from ordinary nightly median restore latency.\n","source":"synthetic:harbor/03-r17-display-and-scope.md"}